tScore artwork: all rights reserved

The tScore name, logo, app icon and banner artwork are copyright 2026 the tScore
project owner (github.com/offdarecord). All rights reserved.

This covers:
  - everything in this assets/ folder (e.g. tscore-banner.jpg);
  - the app icon, apps/desktop/build/icon.ico and apps/desktop/build/icon.png;
  - the results credit's logo, assets/results-credit.jpg, and the copy of it in
    packages/core/src/generated/results-credit.ts (made by npm run gen:credit).

They are NOT licensed under the Apache License 2.0 that covers tScore's code,
nor under the licences for schemas/ (MIT) or docs/ (CC BY 4.0).

You may show them unchanged to refer to tScore itself, for example in a link to
the project, a review, or official tScore builds. Any other use, including in a
modified version of tScore, needs written permission. A modified version must
use a different name and its own icon.

The "Results brought to you by tScore" credit on results PDFs and live results is
defined in one place, packages/core/src/credit.ts. A modified version of tScore must
replace or remove the credit's logo there, and should point its link at its own project.
